@code{agent-log-search-mode} is the major mode used for the @samp{*agent-log-search*} result buffer.  It derives from @code{markdown-view-mode}@comma{} providing Markdown fontification in a read-only buffer.  Session references in the LLM's narrative are replaced with clickable links: pressing @samp{RET} or clicking on them opens the corresponding rendered session log via @code{agent-log-search-follow-link}.

